{'symbol': 'BG', 'date': '2022-08-22 07:00:00', 'title': 'BUNGE TO PARTICIPATE AT BARCLAYS GLOBAL CONSUMER STAPLES CONFERENCE', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BUNGE LIMITED (NYSE: BG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GREG HECKMAN, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, AND JOHN NEPPL, CHIEF FINANCE OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE BARCLAYS GLOBAL CONSUMER STAPLES CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 7, AT 1:30 P.M. ET. THE LINK TO THE WEBCAST WILL BE AVAILABLE ON WWW.BUNGE.COM IN THE “EVENTS AND PRESENTATIONS” SECTION. ABOUT BUNGE AT BUNGE (WWW.BUNGE.COM, NYSE: BG), OUR PURPOSE IS TO CONNECT FARMERS TO CONSUMERS TO DELIVER ESSENTIA'}